  source_id "chronicle_1770772409816_ezz84r"
  title "Too Deep, Too Long — Do Not Approach"
  summary "The Cell has issued a wanted notice for Glow-Trader Vaulius-Phantasm~ and associate Void-Merchant Valveus-morb~ for breaking the Pactum∴silenti by diverting glacial passages to unregistered buyers, selling unauthorized aurora-crystals from below surveyed depths, and extracting material from sanctified ground near the Glow-Fissure. The Cell offers twelve fire-cores for information leading to Vaulius-Phantasm~'s capture and an additional four cores for Valveus-morb~, with warnings that the suspect should not be approached due to exposure to dangerous entities and materials from forbidden depths."
